{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-112","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与截差无理线段与二项无理线段","englishTitle":"The square on a rational straight line applied to the binomial straight line produces as breadth an apotome the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the binomial and moreover in the same ratio; and further the apotome so arising will have the same order as the binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":112,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":112,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","contentId":"euclid-10-112","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3dbee953678573d83783e90af2a09ac8a17dd3fa97953c79b165a3568d6fd738","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-112.statement","euclid-10-112.construction.1","euclid-10-112.proof.1","euclid-10-112.proof.2","euclid-10-112.proof.3","euclid-10-112.construction.2","euclid-10-112.construction.3","euclid-10-112.proof.4","euclid-10-112.proof.5","euclid-10-112.proof.6","euclid-10-112.proof.7","euclid-10-112.proof.8","euclid-10-112.proof.9","euclid-10-112.proof.10","euclid-10-112.proof.11","euclid-10-112.proof.12","euclid-10-112.proof.13","euclid-10-112.proof.14","euclid-10-112.proof.15","euclid-10-112.proof.16","euclid-10-112.conclusion","euclid-10-112.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-112.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"958bbaf17a659371ad873e0ddaa8b05a181f7367f3db78853a57349dfa1e4913","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a rational straight line applied to the binomial straight line produces as breadth an apotome the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the binomial and moreover in the same ratio; and further the apotome so arising will have the same order as the binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把有理线段的平方所对应的面积应用到二项无理线段上，所得宽度是一条截差无理线段；它的各项与二项无理线段的对应项可公度，并且对应项成相同的比例。所得截差无理线段与原二项无理线段属于同一类别。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b01d750f51a5f25445c4a37c8aa8400b74811d01c9963c6304f485b38c9446d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be a rational straight line, let BC be a binomial, and let DC be its greater term; let the rectangle BC, EF be equal to the square on A; I say that EF is an apotome the terms of which are commensurable with CD, DB, and in the same ratio, and further EF will have the same order as BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A成为有理线段,让BC成为二项无理线段,让DC成为更大的任期;让矩形,BC,EF等于A的正方形;我说,EF是截差无理线段,其中可公度和CD,DB是同一比例,还有EF将按BC的顺序排列。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3409e278573be079c0c35504afca24a818672384ba82e9e076b84e9ccd01cef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For again let the rectangle BD, G be equal to the square on A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再一次让矩形 BD,G 等于正方形对A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73bcd5b145e92e12a420583faf89d767460aed27df53c9a0c123ce8bbef37c1f","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the rectangle BC, EF is equal to the rectangle BD, G, therefore, as CB is to BD, so is G to EF. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,矩形 BC EF等于矩形 BD,G,CB比BD,CB比G比EF；CB 与 BD 之比等于 G 与 EF 之比。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4373a915c8454ca43628b413d95fb34d0edbdc92e2fdeefa57e8279821dce67d","citations":["euclid-5-16","euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CB is greater than BD; therefore G is also greater than EF. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16), [V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CB大于BD;因此,G件也大于EF件。[ 音 ] [ [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16) [V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db308d5ad1598e50fc441c1f4b0682500e2193cec1310b31a7543e86666f70c9","citations":["euclid-5-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EH be equal to G; therefore, as CB is to BD, so is HE to EF; therefore, separando, as CD is to BD, so is HF to FE. [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH等于G;因此,CB比BD等于HE比EF;因此,塞帕兰多,CD比BD等于HF比FE；CB 与 BD 之比等于 HE 与 EF 之比；CD 与 BD 之比等于 HF 与 FE 之比。 [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4600d907b17328d8138ee9c4141eb2398c3b0dd479d49e57e86d14ea4ca0840c","citations":["euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as HF is to FE, so is FK to KE; therefore also the whole HK is to the whole KF as FK is to KE; for, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so are all the antecedents to all the consequents. [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设HF对FE的比等于FK对KE的比;因此,整个HK的比是KF对FK对KE;因为,先兆之一就是后果之一,所有后果的先兆也是这样；HF 与 FE 之比等于 FK 与 KE 之比。 [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e78120db2d46e4a2bc8a9be9cbbcd29a7b39f78b673a957f68d929e367b9c2a4","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as FK is to KE, so is CD to DB; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore also, as HK is to KF, so is CD to DB. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,FK对KE的比等于CD对DB的比;因此,HK对KF的比等于CD对DB的比；FK 与 KE 之比等于 CD 与 DB 之比；HK 与 KF 之比等于 CD 与 DB 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2c2500dd290fb4d2c726e8bdc27365df4bc13ef1af3a05bd8af5616d1ee5eda","citations":["euclid-10-36","euclid-6-22","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on CD is commensurable with the square on DB; [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)] therefore the square on HK is also commensurable with the square on KF. [[VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是，以 CD 为边作的正方形与以 DB 为边作的正方形可公度；因此，以 HK 为边作的正方形也与以 KF 为边作的正方形可公度。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)] [VI. 22](/principles/euclid-6-22) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37247cd9db5b89b718113c1e8a11c3d4dcb126faf8f3da7b22051e4919489fb2","citations":["euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as the square on HK is to the square on KF, so is HK to KE, since the three straight lines HK, KF, KE are proportional. [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HK比正方形等于HK比KE,因为三条直线HK,KF比正方形等于成比例。 [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb46c9e74de8f3ca285033f27e610154b5d0fdb7151ab52254ce6ff28d60afe5","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore HK is commensurable in length with KE, so that HE is also commensurable in length with EK. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HK是长度可公度和KE,HE也是长度可公度和EK。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb90e059305562aea6c5d2009edad0b5c3bc115f300c0e8b27e348e9b0103cc4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the square on A is equal to the rectangle EH, BD, while the square on A is rational, therefore the rectangle EH, BD is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为以 A 为边作的正方形面积等于以 EH、BD 为边的矩形面积，而以 A 为边作的正方形面积为有理面积，所以以 EH、BD 为边的矩形面积也为有理面积。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8208311fdd09715c2b6aa22d3bc98b0ffe68138da135d5cc599663bd18269754","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line BD; therefore EH is rational and commensurable in length with BD; [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)] so that EK, being commensurable with it, is also rational and commensurable in length with BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 BD;因此,EH为有理和长度可公度为BD;因此,EK为可公度为有理和长度可公度为BD。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"263acb79f8e61ec8a28f1ec8c42f8cca03e13af369e0b37e459ddd6856c38c0a","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, as CD is to DB, so is FK to KE, while CD, DB are straight lines commensurable in square only, therefore FK, KE are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,CD比DB等于FK比KE,CD比DB是直线平方可公度而长度不可公度,因此FK比KE也等于平方可公度而长度不可公度；CD 与 DB 之比等于 FK 与 KE 之比。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1403a0b7bcccbc542a754719c1bed59b4fa042b69dad02b6dc4517155a1a0cde","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But KE is rational; therefore FK is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KE是有理,因此FK也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50dfb50a4298b98dc8c3fc40a8dfb0ebf07f0bf97e39efcb325578643735a2ff","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FK, KE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FK,KE是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d5e4303628037be8494210487f73cbc4aab199309959fb5cadd406552c722d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the square on CD is greater than the square on DB either by the square on a straight line commensurable with CD or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,CD的正方形比DB的正方形要高,或者比可公度直线正方形CD直线可公度高,或者比正方形直线不可公度高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf9d621be6ad50384d0faa056f3c8506c703f047a43b9be6c4397db23090f961","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then the square on CD is greater than the square on DB by the square on a straight line commensurable with CD, the square on FK is also greater than the square on KE by the square on a straight line commensurable with FK. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CD上的正方形比DB的正方形长,可公度比CD线正方形大,FK线比KE线正方形正方形比FK线可公度正方形还大。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a325f3cc6ffd1a830d80f9dddcd526d7f8c7416af95cb15eee0bc9e875d32f52","citations":["euclid-10-11","euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if CD is commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, so also is FK; [[X. 11, 12](/principles/euclid-10-11)] if BD is so commensurable, so also is KE; [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] but, if neither of the straight lines CD, DB is so commensurable, neither of the straight lines FK, KE is so."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CD是长度可公度 和有理线段设置FK也是如此;如果BD是这样可公度、KE也是这样;但是,如果不是CD线,DB线是可公度线, 也不是FK线,KE线是。 [[X. 11, 12](/principles/euclid-10-11)] [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c5002dfd07c3d97979f333d3c09b61c668dcf5b64ad29c5d00cad324753d36e","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on CD is greater than the square on DB by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CD, the square on FK is also greater than the square on KE by the square on a straight line incommensurable with FK. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果CD的正方形比DB的正方形高,不可公度比CD线比正方形比CD线比正方形,FK线比KE线比正方形比不可公度比FK线比正方形比正方形比号线比正方形比不可公度比FK线比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a79998a3159ab3a42e2be7c4d313700543fe3f6550040f49f44eb2e397df0f59","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if CD is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, so also is FK; if BD is so commensurable, so also is KE; but, if neither of the straight lines CD, DB is so commensurable, neither of the straight lines FK, KE is so; so that FE is an apotome, the terms of which FK, KE are commensurable with the terms CD, DB of the binomial straight line and in the same ratio, and it has the same order as BC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CD是可公度,有理线段是有理线段,FK也是可公度;如果BD是可公度,KE也是KE;如果CD,DB是可公度,FK,FK是可公度;如果不是FK,FK,KE是可公度,FE,可公度,FK,FK,二项无理线段,CD,DB,同一比例,其顺序与BC,Q,E,D相同；这里涉及截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-112.source","contentId":"euclid-10-112","revisionId":"euclid-10-112@raw-3dbee953678573d8","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67c8bb1c1635b6b8db8c288771cef1f5b0902019a7df48fd7da512eb6dc14a13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-112:euclid-6-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-112","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-112.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.112/","sourceLabel":"VI. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-112:euclid-5-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-112","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-112.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2: